      "content": "Hey, I need some help writing a performance review for one of my Senior Account Executives. They've been killing it with client retention and keeping accounts steady, which is huge for us right now. But, I have to address their punctuality because they've been showing up late to our internal morning stand-ups pretty consistently. Can you help me draft something that's professional but constructive?",
